data.arguments:
{"title": "需求台账确认面板", "description": "台账已生成：32 条原子要求（技术要求 17、提交/格式/合规 13、补遗约束 2），5 项阻断、10 项待确认，发布门禁结论为「不通过」。请在面板中确认基线与 4 个关键待确认项的处置方式，或直接书面回复编号。", "interaction_hint": "选择基线处理方式与 Q-01～Q-04 的处置结论后点击「提交确认」。", "html": "<div class="wrap">
  <style>
    .wrap{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary,#e8e8ea);background:transparent;padding:4px 2px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55}
    h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}
    .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .card{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--dsw-alias-label-primary,#888) 22%,transparent);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--dsw-alias-label-primary,#888) 5%,transparent)}
    .card .n{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.3px}
    .card .l{opacity:.68;font-size:11.5px;margin-top:2px}
    .block{border-left:3px solid #d9534f;padding:2px 0 2px 10px;margin:0 0 8px}
    .block b{color:#e57373}
    .muted{opacity:.62;font-size:12px}
    .grp{margin:12px 0 0;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--dsw-alias-label-primary,#888) 15%,transparent);padding-top:10px}
    .q{margin:9px 0 0}
    .q .t{font-weight:600;font-size:12.5px}
    .opts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:5px}
    label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--dsw-alias-label-primary,#888) 24%,transparent);border-radius:14px;padding:3px 9px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}
    label:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--dsw-alias-label-primary,#888) 45%,transparent)}
    input[type=radio],input[type=checkbox]{margin:0;accent-color:#4c8bf5}
    button{margin-top:14px;background:#4c8bf5;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
    #done{display:none;margin-top:12px;color:#4caf7d;font-weight:600}
  </style>
  <h3>台账状态摘要</h3>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card"><div class="n">32</div><div class="l">原子要求</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="n">19 / 12 / 1</div><div class="l">P0 / P1 / P2（推断）</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="n" style="color:#e57373">5</div><div class="l">阻断项</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="n">不通过</div><div class="l">发布门禁</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="block"><b>B-01</b> 15,000 资产容量无压测证据 → 只能标「待验证/规划能力」</div>
  <div class="block"><b>B-02</b> PDF 导出能力缺失（当前仅 Markdown/DOCX）→ REQ-014/SUB-007/008</div>
  <div class="block"><b>B-04</b> 99.9% 可用性无测试或合同依据 → 不得写成已实现</div>
  <div class="muted">另：B-03 旧附件 10,000/99.5% 冲突已记录；B-05 页数门禁未执行。</div>

  <div class="grp">
    <div class="q">
      <div class="t">1. 基线处理（原 10,000 与补遗 15,000）</div>
      <div class="opts">
        <label><input type="radio" name="base" value="accept_amendment">接受补遗 15,000 为唯一基线</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="base" value="keep_both">保留双值并标注冲突</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="base" value="wait">暂不冻结，等澄清</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="q">
      <div class="t">2. Q-02　15,000 容量证据</div>
      <div class="opts">
        <label><input type="radio" name="q02" value="has_report">已有压测报告</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="q02" value="plan_only">仅有压测计划</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="q02" value="none">暂无材料</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="q">
      <div class="t">3. Q-04　PDF 输出与文本可检索</div>
      <div class="opts">
        <label><input type="radio" name="q04" value="can_build">可实现，按能力写入</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="q04" value="deviation">走偏离/替代方案</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="q04" value="pending">待研发确认</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="q">
      <div class="t">4. Q-03　99.9% 可用性表述口径</div>
      <div class="opts">
        <label><input type="radio" name="q03" value="target">写为设计目标+待验证</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="q03" value="contract">按合同条款承诺</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="q03" value="pending">待商务/法务确认</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="q">
      <div class="t">是否需要我下一步生成方案正文骨架（含 80 页预算分配与图表）？</div>
      <div class="opts">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="next" value="outline">需要，先出章节骨架</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="next" value="matrix">需要，先出评分响应矩阵</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <button id="sub">提交确认</button>
  <div id="done">已提交，等待智能体继续处理。</div>

  <script>
    const btn = document.getElementById('sub');
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const g = n => (document.querySelector('input[name="'+n+'"]:checked') || {}).value || null;
      const next = [...document.querySelectorAll('input[name="next"]:checked')].map(x => x.value);
      window.dsh.emit('ledger_confirm', {
        baseline: g('base'),
        q02: g('q02'),
        q03: g('q03'),
        q04: g('q04'),
        next
      });
      btn.disabled = true;
      document.getElementById('done').style.display = 'block';
    });
  </script>
</div>"}
